## Scope

This closes the finite negative-rewind branch only. Zero-size and cyclic
counting remain bounded Rust outcomes because Java does not make progress on
those inputs. Broad P18-V01 source/API/settings/input/error/control-flow and
reverse-export reconciliation remains PARTIAL. Native Windows runtime and
current-revision remote Ubuntu CI remain unverified; Phase 19 Broker/Docker
validation remains separate. No push or remote CI was run. Protected Phase 19
worktree paths remain unstaged and unchanged.
